## 2. Founding Ambassadors (real VAs)

- **Who:** verified VAs (any tier) who are kind, active and trusted. Cap: `ambassador_cap` (50).
- **How:** they apply at **More → 🌟 Founding Ambassadors**; you approve in **Circle Ops → Creators**.
- **Perks:** 90 days of free Tier 2 · Circle Pro (`ambassador_days`), the 🌟 badge on every post, the founding leaderboard (ranked by invited members who completed verification), first invites to new features.
- **Weekly playbook (about 30 minutes):** welcome 3 new members · answer 2 questions (add real experience under any host reply) · share one win, tip or honest struggle · invite VAs they trust · post or react on Circle Laughs · report anything scammy.
- **Rules:** speak as yourself · tell people you're an ambassador when inviting · never promise jobs or income · keep it on-platform.

Referral commissions still apply as usual: an ambassador whose invitee pays for something earns the normal referral share.

---

## 3. Your weekly founder rhythm (2 hours)

| Day | 40 minutes |
|---|---|
| **Monday · Pulse** | Circle Ops → Pulse (new members, activity) and → Hosts (day of 90, fade level, the week's host posts). Thank 3 ambassadors by name in a post |
| **Wednesday · Escalations** | Reports, flags, disputes, KYC queue. Review ambassador applications |
| **Friday · Strategy** | Pick next week's outreach segment from RECRUITING.md; send 10 personal invitations; write one real post yourself |

## 4. Milestones to watch

| By | Aim | If you're behind |
|---|---|---|
| Day 7 | 25 verified members, 5 ambassadors | Personally invite from your own network; post in the groups you're already part of (as yourself) |
| Day 30 | 100 members, 15 ambassadors, members answering before the hosts | Run a "first-client story" week; ask ambassadors to bring one batchmate each |
| Day 60 | 250 members, hosts in light mode most days | Launch Circle Mentors gigs; invite 3 practitioners and 2 comedians |
| Day 90 | 500 members, hosts paused or light, first client job posts | Switch hosts off or keep them light; thank the founding ambassadors publicly |

These are targets, not forecasts. What matters most is **the share of posts that get a reply from a real member within 3 hours**. When that's high, the circle is running itself.

## 5. After day 90

The calendar ends on its own. Keep or switch off the hosts' welcomes and replies (many communities keep a labeled helper). Ambassador Tier 2 ends after 90 days; renew the best ambassadors by approving a new application, or move them to Circle Mentors where they can earn.
